{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217600","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1321760001:0":{"text":"이건 무슨 종목이지? 어째서 반죽이 이렇게나 많은 건가?","source_cn":"这是什么项目？为什么也有这么多面团？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55A3568E555C9FA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321760002:1":{"text":"이건 <style=\"highlight\">반죽 눈싸움</style>이에요! 제전의 눈싸움 시합과 달리 눈덩이 반죽으로 과녁을 맞히면 게임은 끝나죠.","source_cn":"这是<style=highlight>面团雪仗</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED5485BA6952E7DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321760003:1":{"text":"...이것도 리아 부인께서 개선한 건가?","source_cn":"……这又是莉娅女士的改良？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDCFA1949288989D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321760004:1":{"text":"네... 공주님의 건강 상태로 격렬한 운동은 적합하지 않아서요.","source_cn":"是的……毕竟公主殿下的身体实在不适合剧烈运动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA90FD73896CBF57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321760005:1":{"text":"공주님께서 달리기를 못하시는 건 그렇다 쳐도, 눈싸움을 할 때 감히 공주님께 눈덩이를 던지는 사람은 아무도 없을 거예요...","source_cn":"就算真的要打雪仗，先不说公主殿下能不能跑步，只怕也没人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6803E94303CB47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321760006:1":{"text":"속상한 얘기는 이제 그만 할게요. 여러분, 어서 <style=\"highlight\">반죽 눈싸움</style>에 참가해 보세요! 정말 재미있는 데다 기술도 필요한 놀이랍니다!","source_cn":"不提这些难过的事啦。各位大人，快来试一试<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82205D7113E92471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"근위대장 로드리고","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:侍女英加":{"text":"시녀 잉가","source":"侍女英加","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}